Makefile.am: do not build the pppd-logwtmp plugin

plugins/ builds pptpd-logwtmp.so, a pppd plugin for logging PPTP
connections to wtmp. It needs pppd's own internal headers (pppd/pppd.h,
part of pppd's plugin-development headers), which the ppp recipe here does
not package - this is only a plugin, not required for a working PPTP
server. Skip the subdirectory rather than add a dependency for one
logging convenience feature that this test server does not need.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [pptpd upstream is dead - last release 2009,
project abandoned since]

--- a/Makefile.am
+++ b/Makefile.am
@@ -51,7 +51,7 @@
 
 bcrelay_SOURCES = bcrelay.c defaults.h our_syslog.h our_getopt.h
 
-subdirs = plugins
+subdirs =
 
 all-local:
 	for d in $(subdirs); do $(MAKE) $(MFLAGS) -C $$d all; done
